F571                             ; a-z, unchecked: a variable followed by @ or ! is fetched or stored in the
F571                             ; same step; otherwise its address is pushed, and the character after it,
F571                             ; read already, is dispatched from A or Y.
F571   A0 00        FVA:      LDY   #0   ; a
F573   B1 00                  LDA   (IP),Y   
F575   C9 40                  CMP   #"@"   
F577   F0 22                  BEQ   fvaf   
